
ex:
===
-rw-r--r-- 1 viswa developers 2048 Aug  2 18:30 file.txt

| Property                | Example       | Description                                                                        |
| ----------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| File Type & Permissions | `-rw-r--r--`  | Indicates whether it's a file or directory and the read/write/execute permissions. |
| Hard Link Count         | `1`           | Number of hard links pointing to the file.                                         |
| Owner                   | `viswa`       | User who owns the file.                                                            |
| Group                   | `developers`  | Group that owns the file.                                                          |
| Size                    | `2048`        | File size in bytes.                                                                |
| Modified Date           | `Aug 2 18:30` | Last modification time.                                                            |
| Name                    | `file.txt`    | File or directory name.                                                            |



The first character indicates the type.

| Symbol | Type              |
| ------ | ----------------- |
| `-`    | Regular file      |
| `d`    | Directory         |
| `l`    | Symbolic link     |
| `c`    | Character device  |
| `b`    | Block device      |
| `p`    | Named pipe (FIFO) |
| `s`    | Socket            |
